425 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 296 0 R
/E (    AI-Powered Adaptive Audiobook for Visually Impaired Students Education is a fundamental right, yet visually impaired students face significant challenges in accessing educational content due to the lack of adaptive learning tools. Existing audiobooks and screen readers provide one-way, static narration, which fails to accommodate individual learning needs, making comprehension and retention difficult. EchoLearn is an AI-powered adaptive audiobook system designed to bridge this accessibility gap. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
426 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 296 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
427 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 296 0 R
/E (To enhance retention, the system provides AI-driven smart summaries and personalized memory recall reminders based on user progress. Additionally, gamification features such as progress tracking, achievements, and AI-generated quizzes keep learners motivated. With offline accessibility and full voice control, EchoLearn empowers visually impaired students to learn independently without human assistance. By combining AI, natural language processing, and gamification, EchoLearn offers a revolutionary approach to accessible education, ensuring that every student, regardless of disability, can engage with knowledge effectively. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
