/E (     The EchoLearn system provides an accessible educational platform designed to help students access learning materials conveniently. It combines a user-friendly interface, an audiobook module, and a sign language module to support different learning needs. The system allows students to navigate the available features, listen to educational content through audio playback, and use the implemented sign language functionality. These features aim to reduce difficulties in accessing study materials and encourage independent learning. The overall output demonstrates how assistive technology can make educational resources more accessible and improve the learning experience.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [2]
>>
