<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 330 0 R
/E (    One of the key insights gained from the project was that learning is more effective when accessibility is combined with understanding and practice. Traditional audiobooks primarily focus on listening to content, whereas EchoLearn aims to extend the learning experience through text summarization, keyword extraction, question-answer generation, quizzes, and adaptive learning features.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
840 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 330 0 R
/E (   The project also highlighted the importance of multilingual support, voice-based interaction, and simplified explanations in making educational resources accessible to learners with different needs. By integrating these capabilities into a single platform, EchoLearn aims to reduce barriers to independent learning and promote equal educational opportunities.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
841 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 330 0 R
/E (    The project successfully established a foundation for an integrated learning platform that combines audiobook generation with AI-assisted educational features. It also demonstrated the potential of technology to support Sustainable Development Goal 4 \(Quality Education\) and contribute to inclusive and equitable learning opportunities.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
